# Summary of Issues and Resolutions

| # | Error/Warning                               | Root Cause                          | Resolution                             |
| - | ------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| 1 | `cannot import name 'dataplex_v1'`          | Dataplex dependency unavailable     | Install `google-cloud-dataplex`        |
| 2 | `name 'google' is not defined`              | Missing `google.auth` import        | Add `import google.auth`               |
| 3 | `unexpected keyword argument 'tool_config'` | Incorrect ADK constructor parameter | Use `bigquery_tool_config`             |
| 4 | `google.adk.tools.bigquery is deprecated`   | Deprecated import path              | Use `google.adk.integrations.bigquery` |

